  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_8218.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este domingo se ha celebrado en Onda la procesi&oacute;n en honor de Sant Pere, dentro de la fiestas del barrio que lleva el nombre del santo, desde donde ha sido trasladado a la iglesia de la Asunci&oacute;n, para regresar a su calle tras la misa.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8207.jpg\" alt=\"img_8207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8208.jpg\" alt=\"img_8208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8209.jpg\" alt=\"img_8209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8210.jpg\" alt=\"img_8210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8211.jpg\" alt=\"img_8211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8212.jpg\" alt=\"img_8212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8213.jpg\" alt=\"img_8213\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8214.jpg\" alt=\"img_8214\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantpereonda14/img_8215.jpg\" alt=\"img_8215\" style=\"max-